  (text "Keep-alive: KA square wave (about 10 kHz) charges KY; Q holds OE_N low (outputs on). KA stops -> OE_N pulled high -> all outputs off in about 1 ms." (at 140 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 07ce1a08-a08d-4578-81c4-3908b87ccab1))
  (text "KA must be toggled by firmware (once per scheduler frame), NOT by a free-running timer: a timer keeps toggling through a hang or a debugger halt." (at 140 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5ca707c6-e9e0-426e-8cc8-6e96368b3219))
  (text "JP bypasses the keep-alive for debugging only. Leave open in normal use." (at 140 176 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1aa47576-b07f-40bf-9e44-483210d927fc))
